{"page":111,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:18","surah":5,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالَتِ ٱلْيَهُودُ وَٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ نَحْنُ أَبْنَـٰٓؤُا۟ ٱللَّهِ وَأَحِبَّـٰٓؤُهُۥ ۚ قُلْ فَلِمَ يُعَذِّبُكُم بِذُنُوبِكُم ۖ بَلْ أَنتُم بَشَرٌ مِّمَّنْ خَلَقَ ۚ يَغْفِرُ لِمَن يَشَآءُ وَيُعَذِّبُ مَن يَشَآءُ ۚ وَلِلَّهِ مُلْكُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا ۖ وَإِلَيْهِ ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The Jews and the Christians say, ‘We are the children of God and His beloved ones.’ Say, ‘Then why does He punish you for your sins? You are merely human beings, part of His creation: He forgives whoever He will and punishes whoever He will. Control of the heavens and earth and all that is between them belongs to Him: all journeys lead to Him.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالَتِ","en_gloss":"And said","transliteration":"waqālati","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْيَهُودُ","en_gloss":"the Jews","transliteration":"l-yahūdu","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ","en_gloss":"and the Christians","transliteration":"wal-naṣārā","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَحْنُ","en_gloss":"We (are)","transliteration":"naḥnu","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَبْنَـٰٓؤُا۟","en_gloss":"(the) children","transliteration":"abnāu","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَأَحِبَّـٰٓؤُهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"and His beloved","transliteration":"wa-aḥibbāuhu","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَلِمَ","en_gloss":"Then why","transliteration":"falima","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُعَذِّبُكُم","en_gloss":"(does He) punish you","transliteration":"yuʿadhibukum","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِذُنُوبِكُم ۖ","en_gloss":"for your sins","transliteration":"bidhunūbikum","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَنتُم","en_gloss":"you (are)","transliteration":"antum","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَشَرٌۭ","en_gloss":"human beings","transliteration":"basharun","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِّمَّنْ","en_gloss":"from among (those)","transliteration":"mimman","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":16,"ar":"خَلَقَ ۚ","en_gloss":"He created","transliteration":"khalaqa","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يَغْفِرُ","en_gloss":"He forgives","transliteration":"yaghfiru","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":18,"ar":"لِمَن","en_gloss":"[for] whom","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":19,"ar":"يَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَيُعَذِّبُ","en_gloss":"and punishes","transliteration":"wayuʿadhibu","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":21,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":22,"ar":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":23,"ar":"وَلِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"And for Allah","transliteration":"walillahi","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":24,"ar":"مُلْكُ","en_gloss":"(is the) dominion","transliteration":"mul'ku","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":26,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":27,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":28,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمَا ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) between them","transliteration":"baynahumā","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":29,"ar":"وَإِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"and to Him","transliteration":"wa-ilayhi","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":30,"ar":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_gloss":"(is) the final return","transliteration":"l-maṣīru","verse_key":"5:18"},{"pos":31,"ar":"١٨","en_gloss":"(18)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:18"}]},{"verse_key":"5:19","surah":5,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَهْلَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ قَدْ جَآءَكُمْ رَسُولُنَا يُبَيِّنُ لَكُمْ عَلَىٰ فَتْرَةٍ مِّنَ ٱلرُّسُلِ أَن تَقُولُوا۟ مَا جَآءَنَا مِنۢ بَشِيرٍ وَلَا نَذِيرٍ ۖ فَقَدْ جَآءَكُم بَشِيرٌ وَنَذِيرٌ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"People of the Book, Our Messenger comes to you now, after a break in the sequence of messengers, to make things clear for you in case you should say, ‘No one has come to give us good news or to warn us.’ So someone has come to you, to give you good news and warn you: God has the power to do all things.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَهْلَ","en_gloss":"O People","transliteration":"yāahla","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Surely","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"جَآءَكُمْ","en_gloss":"has come to you","transliteration":"jāakum","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَسُولُنَا","en_gloss":"Our Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlunā","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُبَيِّنُ","en_gloss":"he makes clear","transliteration":"yubayyinu","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"[on]","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَتْرَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"(after) an interval (of cessation)","transliteration":"fatratin","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلرُّسُلِ","en_gloss":"the Messengers","transliteration":"l-rusuli","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"lest","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَقُولُوا۟","en_gloss":"you say","transliteration":"taqūlū","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":15,"ar":"جَآءَنَا","en_gloss":"(has) come to us","transliteration":"jāanā","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بَشِيرٍۢ","en_gloss":"bearer of glad tidings","transliteration":"bashīrin","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":19,"ar":"نَذِيرٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"a warner","transliteration":"nadhīrin","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":20,"ar":"فَقَدْ","en_gloss":"But surely","transliteration":"faqad","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":21,"ar":"جَآءَكُم","en_gloss":"has come to you","transliteration":"jāakum","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":22,"ar":"بَشِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"a bearer of glad tidings","transliteration":"bashīrun","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":23,"ar":"وَنَذِيرٌۭ ۗ","en_gloss":"and a warner","transliteration":"wanadhīrun","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":24,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":25,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"(is) on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":26,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":27,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":28,"ar":"قَدِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Powerful","transliteration":"qadīrun","verse_key":"5:19"},{"pos":29,"ar":"١٩","en_gloss":"(19)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:19"}]},{"verse_key":"5:20","surah":5,"ayah":20,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ قَالَ مُوسَىٰ لِقَوْمِهِۦ يَـٰقَوْمِ ٱذْكُرُوا۟ نِعْمَةَ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْكُمْ إِذْ جَعَلَ فِيكُمْ أَنۢبِيَآءَ وَجَعَلَكُم مُّلُوكًا وَءَاتَىٰكُم مَّا لَمْ يُؤْتِ أَحَدًا مِّنَ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Moses said to his people, ‘My people, remember God’s blessing on you: how He raised prophets among you and appointed kings for you and gave you what he had not given to any other people.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مُوسَىٰ","en_gloss":"Musa","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِقَوْمِهِۦ","en_gloss":"to his people","transliteration":"liqawmihi","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"O my people","transliteration":"yāqawmi","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱذْكُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"remember","transliteration":"udh'kurū","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نِعْمَةَ","en_gloss":"(the) Favor","transliteration":"niʿ'mata","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"upon you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":11,"ar":"جَعَلَ","en_gloss":"He placed","transliteration":"jaʿala","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِيكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"fīkum","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَنۢبِيَآءَ","en_gloss":"Prophets","transliteration":"anbiyāa","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَجَعَلَكُم","en_gloss":"and made you","transliteration":"wajaʿalakum","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مُّلُوكًۭا","en_gloss":"kings","transliteration":"mulūkan","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَءَاتَىٰكُم","en_gloss":"and He gave you","transliteration":"waātākum","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":18,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":19,"ar":"يُؤْتِ","en_gloss":"He (had) given","transliteration":"yu'ti","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":20,"ar":"أَحَدًۭا","en_gloss":"(to) anyone","transliteration":"aḥadan","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":21,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":22,"ar":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_gloss":"the worlds","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","verse_key":"5:20"},{"pos":23,"ar":"٢٠","en_gloss":"(20)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:20"}]},{"verse_key":"5:21","surah":5,"ayah":21,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ ٱدْخُلُوا۟ ٱلْأَرْضَ ٱلْمُقَدَّسَةَ ٱلَّتِى كَتَبَ ٱللَّهُ لَكُمْ وَلَا تَرْتَدُّوا۟ عَلَىٰٓ أَدْبَارِكُمْ فَتَنقَلِبُوا۟ خَـٰسِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"My people, go into the holy land which God has ordained for you––do not turn back or you will be the losers.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"O my people","transliteration":"yāqawmi","verse_key":"5:21"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱدْخُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"Enter","transliteration":"ud'khulū","verse_key":"5:21"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"the land","transliteration":"l-arḍa","verse_key":"5:21"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمُقَدَّسَةَ","en_gloss":"the Holy","transliteration":"l-muqadasata","verse_key":"5:21"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"allatī","verse_key":"5:21"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَتَبَ","en_gloss":"(has been) ordained","transliteration":"kataba","verse_key":"5:21"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:21"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"5:21"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"5:21"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تَرْتَدُّوا۟","en_gloss":"turn","transliteration":"tartaddū","verse_key":"5:21"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"5:21"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَدْبَارِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your backs","transliteration":"adbārikum","verse_key":"5:21"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَتَنقَلِبُوا۟","en_gloss":"then you will turn back","transliteration":"fatanqalibū","verse_key":"5:21"},{"pos":14,"ar":"خَـٰسِرِينَ","en_gloss":"(as) losers","transliteration":"khāsirīna","verse_key":"5:21"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٢١","en_gloss":"(21)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:21"}]},{"verse_key":"5:22","surah":5,"ayah":22,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟ يَـٰمُوسَىٰٓ إِنَّ فِيهَا قَوْمًا جَبَّارِينَ وَإِنَّا لَن نَّدْخُلَهَا حَتَّىٰ يَخْرُجُوا۟ مِنْهَا فَإِن يَخْرُجُوا۟ مِنْهَا فَإِنَّا دَٰخِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They said, ‘Moses, there is a fearsome people in this land. We will not go there until they leave. If they leave, then we will enter.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَـٰمُوسَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"O Musa","transliteration":"yāmūsā","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَوْمًۭا","en_gloss":"(are) people","transliteration":"qawman","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":6,"ar":"جَبَّارِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) tyrannical strength","transliteration":"jabbārīna","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَإِنَّا","en_gloss":"and indeed, we","transliteration":"wa-innā","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَن","en_gloss":"never","transliteration":"lan","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نَّدْخُلَهَا","en_gloss":"will enter it","transliteration":"nadkhulahā","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَخْرُجُوا۟","en_gloss":"they leave","transliteration":"yakhrujū","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِنْهَا","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"and if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَخْرُجُوا۟","en_gloss":"they leave","transliteration":"yakhrujū","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنْهَا","en_gloss":"[from] it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فَإِنَّا","en_gloss":"then certainly we (will)","transliteration":"fa-innā","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":17,"ar":"دَٰخِلُونَ","en_gloss":"enter (it)","transliteration":"dākhilūna","verse_key":"5:22"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٢٢","en_gloss":"(22)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:22"}]},{"verse_key":"5:23","surah":5,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ رَجُلَانِ مِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ يَخَافُونَ أَنْعَمَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْهِمَا ٱدْخُلُوا۟ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلْبَابَ فَإِذَا دَخَلْتُمُوهُ فَإِنَّكُمْ غَـٰلِبُونَ ۚ وَعَلَى ٱللَّهِ فَتَوَكَّلُوٓا۟ إِن كُنتُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Yet two men whom God had blessed among those who were afraid said, ‘Go in to them through the gate and when you go in you will overcome them. If you are true believers, put your trust in God.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"Said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَجُلَانِ","en_gloss":"two men","transliteration":"rajulāni","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَخَافُونَ","en_gloss":"feared (Allah)","transliteration":"yakhāfūna","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَنْعَمَ","en_gloss":"(had) favored","transliteration":"anʿama","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمَا","en_gloss":"[on] both of them","transliteration":"ʿalayhimā","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱدْخُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"Enter","transliteration":"ud'khulū","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمُ","en_gloss":"upon them","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْبَابَ","en_gloss":"(through) the gate","transliteration":"l-bāba","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"then when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":13,"ar":"دَخَلْتُمُوهُ","en_gloss":"you have entered it","transliteration":"dakhaltumūhu","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فَإِنَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"then indeed, you (will be)","transliteration":"fa-innakum","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":15,"ar":"غَـٰلِبُونَ ۚ","en_gloss":"victorious","transliteration":"ghālibūna","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَعَلَى","en_gloss":"And upon","transliteration":"waʿalā","verse_key":"5:23"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"A